<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel continues air and drone strikes in southern Lebanon, killing a Hezbollah operative and wounding another, and setting homes ablaze, while Hezbollah fires artillery at Israeli positions. Lebanon reports a civilian killed and another wounded by an Israeli strike on a motorcycle, and another strike wounded one person. Hezbollah has begun distributing its first cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon due to the fighting. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQNEh3eUpvZEE3RmtURWlJT254WnE0SWpsZzRMWkladm9zTDk3WThic1c0bHlnM2N5dXlNdGEzZHUzd2NnaDlFMUpURnRnQWxfckFBb0xkMFBXclRkWW9ISldOOTAzcGFROE9LcVVFMlRuX3JQWDU3bkRlQ1BDQW1HWFlrTFdHZjVCYWtUWXZwZS0wVDVBbHpuWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Sole 24 ORE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNTnIzRkJKSFNqTFljVnFPZHRheTVvZXNXLW5HOG5SVHVENGNCVHpaMTBhTnZQVExjaTFxa1R4dXQ5VlRXLXI0NVRVaDdVU25qd2QtM0xZdVdnTGpvVDhENmx0c3JOa3RHdWk2OTNfamtSUmxHZ0k4Ql9vVGk3NjN5c0tWQ3JVYTZudGtSWFJUZUFxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tahrir Institute for Middle East Policy -&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Arabiya English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQQmtjYkFvdUhMWEtJbnZwOUJsSnFXc25Ycm9PT0Z6MEZsZUEwMW02VWExU1Q2Tm1qNDRhZzBGakV3S0xQa2hUc0hnNURQUV9Gdnd4aHY5NEdBUXBHUF94WG8wd01uanZmR